{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820810/extras/e97323f2cbdf5229bbc0fb47c942a82c.poster.avif?t=1762211461\" width=1170 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820810/extras/e97323f2cbdf5229bbc0fb47c942a82c.webm?t=1762211461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice Dice Baby is a casino dice-building roguelike about cheating, changing the rules and rolling the craziest combos to beat the House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roll dice, reroll them, create scoring combinations and beat the score target to move to the next round: easy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twist a classic  dice game into a colorful combo machine thanks to illegal special dice, board modifiers and lucky charms, all in the world's most lenient casino.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick your favorites amongst tens of special dice, each with their own rule-bending abilities. Collect them to create powerful synergies that will completely change the way you play. You can even level them up to increase their scoring potential and get an edge over the unfairly high score targets demanded by the House.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820810/extras/3c2feb5ec1591325b2661e3690445f0d.poster.avif?t=1762211461\" width=935 height=539 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820810/extras/3c2feb5ec1591325b2661e3690445f0d.webm?t=1762211461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip lucky charms to create game-breaking combos and sneaky strategies. Possibilities are endless and each run is sure to be different thanks to over 100 different charms to unlock, combined with the effects of your dice collection.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With lucky charms' special effects ranging from earning you more money, increasing your score or even allowing you to play new dice combinations from other games, they each have a potential to bring the dealer to their knees.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820810/extras/e6658ef7676d6bfd0bc989786307f705.poster.avif?t=1762211461\" width=780 height=122 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3820810/extras/e6658ef7676d6bfd0bc989786307f705.webm?t=1762211461\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beating the game once won't be enough as the House never gives up. Prove you are the ultimate hustler by beating the 3 difficulty levels with every dice types and unlock new content and ways to play dirty.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Randomly generated runs</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6 dice shapes and 9 special dice types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >36 dice synergy effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >88 lucky charms to collect</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of possible score combinations to unlock</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 difficulty levels to beat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragra